---
import Button from "@/components/ui/Button.astro";
import { Section, SectionContent } from "@layout";

// Generar una cuadrícula de 96 tiles con variaciones y delays para el fondo animado
const TILE_COUNT = 96;
const tiles = Array.from({ length: TILE_COUNT }, (_, i) => {
  const mod = (i * 7 + 3) % 11;
  const isAnimated = mod % 2 === 0;
  const delay = (((i * 13) % 40) / 10).toFixed(1);
  const duration = (4.5 + (i % 5) * 1.4).toFixed(1);

  // Escala tonal de brand-brown (#41382f)
  const shade =
    mod === 0
      ? "bg-brand-brown/12"
      : mod === 2
        ? "bg-brand-brown/8"
        : mod === 4
          ? "bg-brand-brown/4"
          : mod === 6
            ? "bg-brand-brown/2"
            : "bg-transparent";

  return {
    isAnimated,
    delay,
    duration,
    shade,
  };
});
---

<Section
  id="hero"
  class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40 bg-surface-canvas flex items-center justify-center min-h-[82vh]"
>
  <!-- Fondo de tiles animados en escalas de brand-brown -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-0 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_80%_65%_at_50%_50%,black_20%,transparent_85%)]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-6 sm:grid-cols-8 md:grid-cols-12 gap-2 sm:gap-2.5 w-[140%] h-[140%] -rotate-2 select-none"
    >
      {tiles.map((tile) => (
        <div
          class:list={[
            "tile-cell rounded-xs border border-brand-brown/10 aspect-square sm:aspect-4/3 transition-colors",
            tile.shade,
            { "animate-tile-pulse": tile.isAnimated },
          ]}
          style={
            tile.isAnimated
              ? `animation-delay: ${tile.delay}s; animation-duration: ${tile.duration}s;`
              : undefined
          }
        />
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Contenido estructurado: Pill -> Headline -> Subtitle -> CTA -->
  <SectionContent
    direction="column"
    class="relative z-10 items-center text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto gap-6 sm:gap-7"
  >
    <!-- 1. Pill -->
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-brown/15 bg-brand-brown/5 text-brand-brown text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide backdrop-blur-xs shadow-xs select-none hover:border-brand-brown/30 transition-colors"
    >
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-rose animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Single Family Office · Capital Privado e Inmobiliario</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Headline -->
    <h1
      class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[68px] font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary leading-[1.08]"
    >
      Reconocemos el valor real y apostamos por él
    </h1>

    <!-- 3. Subtitle -->
    <p
      class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-normal"
    >
      Somos un vehículo ágil de capital privado que inyecta recursos propios en proyectos inmobiliarios de alto potencial, actuando como el socio estratégico que impulsa el crecimiento de la economía real.
    </p>

    <!-- 4. CTA -->
    <div class="pt-2">
      <Button
        href="#contact"
        variant="primary"
        class="px-8 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold shadow-sm hover:opacity-95 transition-all"
      >
        Presentar Proyecto
      </Button>
    </div>
  </SectionContent>
</Section>

<style>
  @keyframes tilePulse {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0.3;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.95;
      background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand-brown) 22%, transparent);
      border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand-brown) 28%, transparent);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }
  }

  .animate-tile-pulse {
    animation: tilePulse infinite ease-in-out both;
  }
</style>
